'''Bliza''' is a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the Rare Cat Capsule during the [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES]] and [[Colossus Busters (Gacha Event)|Colossus Busters]] events. It was added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]] increases health, attack power and backswing length, and grants [[Immune to Toxic|Toxic Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]].

