==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]], Bliza's descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Bliza
An ice specter from edge of the cosmos,
residing on an eternally frozen planet.
Might Slow Aliens/Zombies.</pre>
<pre>Blizana
Commanding frost that freezes all matter around
it, this spirit shatters Barriers with vicious icicles.
Colossus Slayer, tough vs & 100% Slows Aliens & Zombies.</pre>
<pre>Blizarena
Freezes scorching hot stars to their very core.
Her absolute-zero pillars of ice pierce Barriers.
Colossus Slayer, Tough vs/100% Slows Aliens/Zombies.</pre>
**Notably, Bliza's original True Form description referred to Blizarena as "her", something unusual for the [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Elemental Pixies]] who are normally referred to using non-gendered pronouns like "they" or "it".

